# Prettier already reads .gitignore, so node_modules is covered. This file is
# for tracked text Prettier should still keep its hands off.

# Written by release-please from commit messages. The tool owns its layout, and
# reformatting it here would show up as noise in the next release diff.
CHANGELOG.md

# Biome owns every file type it supports. Prettier is here to fill the gaps,
# and the gaps are Markdown and YAML. Listing the rest here means nobody later
# mistakes Prettier's presence for permission to hand it the JavaScript, and
# the day Biome ships a YAML formatter this list grows by one line.
*.json
*.jsonc
*.js
*.mjs
*.cjs
*.jsx
*.ts
*.mts
*.cts
*.tsx
*.css
*.graphql

# Go's own formatter owns these, and it is not negotiable.
*.go
